## Requirements

{% JobChecklist %}

- At least secondary education in electrical engineering
- Basic knowledge of technical drawings
- Knowledge of the Python programming language
- Knowledge of CAD / Solid Edge is an advantage
- Communication skills
- Ability to work independently in a small team
- Thoroughness and an orderly approach

{% /JobChecklist %}

{% /JobColumn %}

{% JobColumn %}

